                  "from": "agent",
                  "text": "First, a read, which runs at once:\n\n```bash\ngit log --oneline -3\n```\n\nThen recreate the worktree. This one writes, so it asks first:\n\n```bash\ngit worktree add \\\n  ../wick-recovered \\\n  -b wick-recovered\n```\n\nAnd one more write, to cancel:\n\n```sh\ntouch notes/lit.md\n```"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Wick",
          "branch": "wick",
          "chats": [
